5	/// [DownloadOpener]'s concrete, `url_launcher`-backed implementation (Code
6	/// Map) — `LaunchMode.externalApplication` always opens [url] outside this
7	/// app (the OS's own browser tab/share sheet/PDF viewer), never inside an
